I've hacked my version so that, if I'm "blessed" by the Gods, I don't
get disintegrated.  This makes things much easier.  A good fix for the
"approved" version would be to adopt the AD&D "Saving Throw"
principle, and add in both luck and blessedness.  As long as Dragons
are not distinguised by color, I believe it to be "too unfair" to have
disintegration be so effective.
